    "背景": "The theorem compares the arithmetic and geometric means of two nonnegative real numbers.",
    "角色 / 重要性": "The two-variable arithmetic-geometric mean inequality is a fundamental comparison between two means and a building block for elementary inequalities.",
    "作用": "It bounds the geometric mean by the arithmetic mean and supports estimates and optimization for nonnegative quantities; equality occurs when the inputs coincide.",
